# One address for everything: the API, real-time sync and the Videmak Cloud gateway go to the
# server, every other path to the web app. SITE_ADDRESS is ":8080" (plain HTTP, put your own
# proxy in front) or your domain, e.g. "write.example.edu" (Caddy then gets an HTTPS certificate).
{$SITE_ADDRESS::8080} {
	encode zstd gzip
	@backend path /api/* /collab /collab/* /v1/*
	reverse_proxy @backend server:4000
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
